      statement: "Agent loses CI debugging context across sessions. Scripts (auto-pr, ci-debug, merge-pr) are the tattoos but can mislead. Need: (1) better CI failure diagnostics, (2) last_stop_check.json should capture CI/PR state, (3) no first-shot assumptions on CI, (4) no parallel work while CI pending, (5) timing awareness for stale fetches/PRs."  # 8ccc
